# On the whiteboard too, no message takes the place of a refused request's notice (#269).
# tests/drive.rs installs the open-tasks example patched to send workspace/open and then a
# notification whenever the tasks change. A card is typed when it asks: when the edit ends,
# the status line says what was not done first, and the notification after it.
size 140x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
env COLD_LAVA_TODAY=2026-11-07
wait-for ☐ 16 open tasks
keys w
wait-for whiteboards · type to filter · ⏎ open · Esc back
type Drafts
keys enter
wait-for whiteboard Drafts · 0 cards
keys n
wait-for editing · type text · ⏎ new line · Esc done (saves)
type Draft
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] Sweep the ash off the roof\n
wait-for ☐ 17 open tasks
wait-for Draft▏
keys esc
wait-for open-tasks wanted to open Volcanoes/Krakatoa.md: not while a card is being edited · so there
expect whiteboard Drafts · 1 cards
screen
keys q
wait-for cold-lava workspaces
keys q
exits 0
